# E263 — FFTW 3.3.10 CMake 写死 FFTW_VERSION 3.3.9 导致 fftw3.pc Version 错误
#
# 格式规则:
#   - key: value（冒号后一个空格，value 到行尾）
#   - 多行值: 下一行以空格开头 = 续行
#   - 列表值: 逗号分隔
#   - 正则值: | 分隔多个模式
#   - 以 # 开头的行为注释

# ═══ Layer 0: 错误面 (Error Surface) ═══
id:                     E263
trigger_tool:           pkg-config|cmake|conan
phase:                  installation|testing
error_signature: pkg-config --modversion fftw3.*3.3.9|Version: 3.3.9|set (FFTW_VERSION 3.3.9)

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
severity:               2
category:               pkg-config-version-mismatch
match_keywords: fftw,pkg-config,fftw3.pc,FFTW_VERSION,CMake,Version field mismatch,upstream hardcoded version
title: FFTW 3.3.10 tarball CMakeLists.txt hardcodes FFTW_VERSION 3.3.9 leaking into fftw3.pc Version field

# ═══ Layer 2: 诊断层 (Diagnosis) ═══
root_cause: Upstream fftw-3.3.10.tar.gz CMakeLists.txt sets FFTW_VERSION 3.3.9 (stale; Autotools configure.ac derives 3.3.10 from FFTW_MAJOR/MINOR). CMake configure_file(fftw.pc.in) then writes Version: 3.3.9 into the installed fftw3.pc, so pkg-config --modversion fftw3 reports the wrong version even though the package is 3.3.10.
affected_scope: FFTW 3.3.10 CMake builds; any consumer reading fftw3.pc Version for version checks; recipe package metadata
verification_cmd: pkg-config --modversion fftw3 | grep -q '^3.3.10'

# ═══ Layer 3: 方案层 (Solution Space) ★ ═══
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach: Add a recipe patch (0002-fftw-version.patch) that bumps set (FFTW_VERSION 3.3.9) to set (FFTW_VERSION 3.3.10) in CMakeLists.txt and register it in conandata.yml patches
rec_description: Do not modify upstream source files in place; ship a small patch via conandata.yml so conan create reproduces it from a clean tarball. Same class of issue affects any library whose CMake hardcodes a stale version while Autotools derives the real one.
rec_command: patch -p1 < patches/0002-fftw-version.patch; conan create . -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:

# 回退方案 (当推荐方案不可用时尝试)
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach: 在 notes.md / PR 正文中说明版本不一致原因，不改配方
fallback_description: 若不允许打补丁，则在配方 notes.md 与 PR 正文明确记录上游 CMake 版本号滞后问题，避免误用
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:

# ★ 禁止策略 ★
forbid_1_pattern: 直接修改 conan cache 内已解压源码|绕过 conandata.yml 手工 sed 源码
forbid_1_reason: 会破坏配方可复现性，conan create 从干净 tarball 无法复现
forbid_1_consequence: W3/CI 复现失败，submit 被拒

# ═══ Layer 4: 原则引用 ═══
principles:

# ═══ 关系图 (Relations) ═══
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             E207
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

